  abilityName: Akem Piercer
  abilityDesc: 16 combo Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    activates Stealth and boosts own Atk and critical rate for 2 turns, fills BB
    gauge, boosts BC, HC drop rate, Item drop rate for 3 turns, spark damage restores
    HP for 3 turns & fills OD gauge
